WEBVTT

02:31.810 --> 02:34.561
Boy, you've got a friend in me

02:34.813 --> 02:35.854
Yee-haw!

02:35.939 --> 02:38.816
Yeah, you've got a friend in me

02:38.900 --> 02:40.526
Hey, cowboy!

02:40.610 --> 02:44.446
Some other folks might be
a little bit smarter than I am

02:44.572 --> 02:46.573
Big and stronger too

02:46.658 --> 02:47.741
Come on, Woody.

02:47.826 --> 02:48.909
Maybe

02:48.993 --> 02:53.705
But none of them will ever
love you the way I do

02:54.124 --> 02:56.625
It's me and you, boy

02:56.709 --> 02:58.085
And as the years go by

02:58.169 --> 02:59.962
Whoa! Whoa!
